  "title": "Quick Wholesome Ethiopian Plum Tomatoes Dulet",
  "description": "A herbal and aerated Ethiopian dish featuring plum tomatoes, whisked to perfection for a weeknight meal, following ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly principles in the form of dulet.",
