      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, cook for another minute.",
    "Add berbere spice, salt, and black pepper, stir for 30 seconds.",
    "Add chopped plum tomatoes, stir well to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Use a whisk to gently aerate the mixture, breaking down the tomatoes.",
    "Stir in chopped fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve hot over injera bread or rice."
  ],
